@b = http://localhost:8151

### N+1 (sqlCount 21)
GET {{b}}/queries/n-plus-one

### JOIN FETCH (1)
GET {{b}}/queries/fetch-join

### @EntityGraph (1)
GET {{b}}/queries/entity-graph

### interface projection (2 columns)
GET {{b}}/queries/projection?maxPrice=200

### DTO projection
GET {{b}}/queries/dto?author=Author 3

### offset page (rows + count)
GET {{b}}/books/offset?page=2&size=10

### slice (no count)
GET {{b}}/books/slice?page=2&size=10

### cursor: first page
GET {{b}}/books/cursor?size=10

### cursor: next page (paste nextCursor)
GET {{b}}/books/cursor?size=10&after={{cursor}}

### insert a cheap row (sorts first) and page again
POST {{b}}/books?title=Cheap&price=1

### optimistic update: version and updatedAt change
PUT {{b}}/books/5/price?price=999

### stock strategies
POST {{b}}/stock/10/reset?to=20

###
POST {{b}}/stock/10/optimistic

###
POST {{b}}/stock/10/pessimistic

###
POST {{b}}/stock/10/atomic

### rollback + REQUIRES_NEW audit
POST {{b}}/orders?bookId=20&fail=true

### checked exception trap
POST {{b}}/orders?bookId=20&mode=checked-default

###
GET {{b}}/audit
